{"file_id":"BRIEFING_MISSION_BLOCK_36DD60","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Snake，我已经设置好你拿到的那台无线电，现在可以用它联系那个女孩——Paz。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":104,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"她没事吧？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"那女孩没我们想的那么脆弱。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"她毕竟还是个孩子……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"正因为如此，说不定反而能从她那里得到有用的情报。而且这次真正的委托人，就是她——“<R=和平,LA PAZ>的使者”……对吧？","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=和平,LA PAZ>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":167,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"……嗯，我知道。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":24,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"我给你接过去。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":21,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"Snake……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":14,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"是你啊。你从哪里通信？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"Ciudad Colón的校舍。老师让我在局势平静下来之前待在学校。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":79,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"老师？啊，那家伙……。……不过，这样更安全。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"嗯……。老师房间里有无线电设备，所以随时都能联系。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"无线电设备……还真是个不得了的老师。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"Snake，一定要把和平带回来。还有……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":53,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"嗯。如果找到你的朋友，我会联系你。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"谢谢。Snake，关于哥斯达黎加的事什么都可以问我。地理、气候、植物，还有历史和法律，我都很熟。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":134,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"知道了。有问题的话，我就来问你。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"……那个……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":21,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"怎么了？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":19,"cn_text":"学校里教过我。“和平对人与人之间的关系而言，是一种不自然的状态”……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":105,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":20,"cn_text":"“人与他人的关系，总是受到战争的威胁。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":21,"cn_text":"嗯。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":6,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":22,"cn_text":"所以，“和平”这种状态，必须靠我们自己创造。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":23,"cn_text":"只是叹息，和平既不会到来，也无法持续。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":24,"cn_text":"必须由自己主动去追求。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":25,"cn_text":"和平需要牺牲。抱歉，我不知道和平究竟是什么。所以我从未感受过和平，也从未对和平产生过兴趣。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":135,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":26,"cn_text":"Snake……？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":14,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":27,"cn_text":"啊……抱歉。Paz，你的想法很了不起。我希望你是对的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":28,"cn_text":"嗯……希望如此。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":24,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":29,"cn_text":"那么，为了那份和平，就请你——<R=和平,PAZ>——帮我。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=和平,PAZ>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":74,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":30,"cn_text":"谢谢。无论什么时候，我都会等着你。再见……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":31,"cn_text":"Snake。你可以用无线电<R=呼叫,CALL>对方。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=呼叫,CALL>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":53,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":32,"cn_text":"不过你现在还在执行任务。通信时也别放松警惕，注意周围的情况。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":33,"cn_text":"明白。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":34,"cn_text":"如果有想了解的哥斯达黎加情报，Paz会回答你。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":35,"cn_text":"知道了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":36,"cn_text":"Snake，我们沿着他们的运输路线追过去。前方应该就是他们的基地。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":89,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":37,"cn_text":"从目前的情况看，他们很可能真的把核武器带进来了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":38,"cn_text":"嗯。关键是确认那支<R=长矛,SPEAR>究竟是不是核武器，以及它的用途。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=长矛,SPEAR>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":91,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":39,"cn_text":"沿着他们的运输路线追，就能找到核武器。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":40,"cn_text":"是啊。先去接触<R=FSLN,SANDINISTA>的<R=司令官,COMANDANTE>，获取前方的当地情报。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=FSLN,SANDINISTA>\",\"<R=司令官,COMANDANTE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":100,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":41,"cn_text":"不过，他们用作藏身处的小屋应该已经遭到袭击并被占领了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":42,"cn_text":"希望他们平安无事。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":43,"cn_text":"Snake，潜入作为据点的小屋，制服警卫，确保<R=FSLN,SANDINISTA>的<R=司令官,COMANDANTE>安全。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=FSLN,SANDINISTA>\",\"<R=司令官,COMANDANTE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":114,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":44,"cn_text":"警卫也可以通过击昏、催眠或富尔顿回收来使其失去行动能力。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":45,"cn_text":"怎么处理就交给你判断了，Boss。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":43,"review_flag":""}]}